    "attributes": {
        "action": "Replace the Tourist Tax with redirection of VAT on hotel revenue to local areas",
        "additional_details": "We believe that levying the Tourist Tax would only increase costs to hard working families on holiday in this country.",
        "background": "Replace the Tourist Tax with a provision directing some of the existing 20% VAT revenue from hotels to benefit local areas. The hotel VAT rate of 20% is currently higher than in some other countries.",
